{"parentUuid":"6e408b19-46ad-4f97-9ad2-d5380fba125e","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"6a5490e7-db98-4c8e-ab2a-d6269cfe62dd","agentId":"afb1dbcc97469a738","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Erxr8bw2bT9QzBNmbM5fVw","type":"tool_result","content":"529:#: (for tool recommendations)\" picker -- built from JOB_TOOLS itself so a\n538:    something useful before touching the picker. Falls back to\n---job.html---\n131:   real gate mes.jobs._validate_status_transition/_require_confirm_evidence\n132:   enforce server-side (>=1 passed/failed test evidence_for, 0 unresolved\n133:   evidence_against); this is display-only, the server call is what\n136:  {%- set _passfail = h.evidence_for|selectattr('kind', 'equalto', 'test')|selectattr('result', 'defined')|selectattr('result', 'in', ['pass', 'fail'])|list -%}\n137:  {%- set _unresolved = h.evidence_against|rejectattr('resolved')|list -%}\n141:       is enforced server-side regardless of evidence -- say so up front\n144:       \"Mark supported first.\" The evidence reason (if any) still follows,\n145:       so a hypothesis that is open *and* short on evidence still carries\n151:      {#- N4: evidence_for can be non-empty (a code/freeze-frame/observation\n152:         chip) while still carrying zero test evidence -- say so explicitly\n154:         self-contradictory sitting under a visible evidence chip. -#}\n155:      {%- if h.evidence_for and h.evidence_for|length -%}\n156:        {{ t('needs_test_result_with_evidence').format(n=h.evidence_for|length) }}\n172:{% macro evidence_chip(e, hyp_id, side, cls) %}\n173:  <span class=\"chip {{ cls }} evidence-chip\">\n174:    {#- N8: free-text evidence (typed into the picker's own label field,\n180:    <span class=\"evidence-chip-label\">{{ e.label }}</span>\n181:    <form method=\"post\" action=\"/v/{{ vin }}/job/{{ job.id }}/hypotheses/{{ hyp_id }}/evidence\" class=\"evidence-remove-form\">\n193:{% macro evidence_picker(h, side) %}\n194:  <details class=\"evidence-picker\">\n195:    <summary>{{ t('evidence_for_add') if side == 'for' else t('evidence_against_add') }}</summary>\n196:    <form method=\"post\" action=\"/v/{{ vin }}/job/{{ job.id }}/hypotheses/{{ h.id }}/evidence\" class=\"evidence-form\">\n200:      <select name=\"_pick\" class=\"evidence-pick\">\n201:        {# R8: \"Choose evidence...\" -- a placeholder, not a status report;\n202:           hardcoded (not t('no_evidence_yet_label')) since i18n.py is\n204:        <option value=\"\">Choose evidence&hellip;</option>\n208:      <input type=\"text\" name=\"label\" placeholder=\"{{ t('system_select_placeholder') }}\" class=\"evidence-free-text\">\n209:      <input type=\"hidden\" name=\"kind\" value=\"observation\" class=\"evidence-kind-field\">\n210:      <input type=\"hidden\" name=\"ref_id\" value=\"\" class=\"evidence-id-field\">\n233:    <div class=\"evidence-row\"><b class=\"small\">{{ t('evidence_for') }}</b> <span class=\"ev-count small muted\">({{ h.evidence_for|length }})</span>\n234:      {% for e in h.evidence_for %}{{ evidence_chip(e, h.id, 'for', 'ok') }}{% else %}<span class=\"muted small\">{{ t('none_yet') }}</span>{% endfor %}\n236:    <div class=\"evidence-row\"><b class=\"small\">{{ t('evidence_against') }}</b> <span class=\"ev-count small muted\">({{ h.evidence_against|length }})</span>\n237:      {% for e in h.evidence_against %}{{ evidence_chip(e, h.id, 'against', 'returned') }}{% else %}<span class=\"muted small\">{{ t('none_yet') }}</span>{% endfor %}\n239:    <div class=\"evidence-pickers\">\n240:      {{ evidence_picker(h, 'for') }}\n241:      {{ evidence_picker(h, 'against') }}\n264:      {# Job UX run 2, R7: name the hypothesis, list the actual evidence\n272:        <div class=\"small confirm-evidence-list\">\n273:          <b>{{ t('evidence_for') }} ({{ h.evidence_for|length }})</b>\n274:          {% for e in h.evidence_for %}<span class=\"chip ok evidence-chip\">{{ e.label }}</span>{% else %}<span class=\"muted\">{{ t('none_yet') }}</span>{% endfor %}\n276:        <div class=\"small confirm-evidence-list\">\n277:          <b>{{ t('evidence_against') }} ({{ h.evidence_against|length }})</b>\n278:          {% for e in h.evidence_against %}<span class=\"chip returned evidence-chip\">{{ e.label }}</span>{% else %}<span class=\"muted\">{{ t('none_yet') }}</span>{% endfor %}\n324:  <div class=\"job-card hyp-card suggested-hyp{{ ' no-evidence' if not s.evidence_for }}\" id=\"sugg-{{ idx }}\">\n331:    <div class=\"evidence-row\"><b class=\"small\">{{ t('evidence_for') }}</b>\n332:      {% for e in s.evidence_for %}<span class=\"chip ok evidence-chip\">{{ e.label }}</span>{% else %}<span class=\"muted small\">{{ t('no_evidence_separated') }}</span>{% endfor %}\n334:    <div class=\"evidence-row\"><b class=\"small\">{{ t('evidence_against') }}</b>\n335:      {% for e in s.evidence_against %}<span class=\"chip returned evidence-chip\">{{ e.label }}</span>{% else %}<span class=\"muted small\">{{ t('none_yet') }}</span>{% endfor %}\n343:      <input type=\"hidden\" name=\"evidence_for\" value='{{ s.evidence_for|tojson }}'>\n344:      <input type=\"hidden\" name=\"evidence_against\" value='{{ s.evidence_against|tojson }}'>\n528:  <h2 id=\"step-7\" class=\"section-h step-title\">7. {{ t(\"hypotheses\") }}</h2>\n582:             silently dropping the pre-tick for a code this picker would\n829:          <p><span class=\"lab\">Confirmed, with evidence:</span> {{ case_result.confirmed_hypothesis.text }}{% if case_result.confirmed_hypothesis.evidence_summary %} &mdash; {{ case_result.confirmed_hypothesis.evidence_summary }}{% endif %}</p>","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"3e2e457d-9d46-4d05-b52d-383f4573afe4","timestamp":"2026-10-14T00:23:28.962Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"529:#: (for tool recommendations)\" picker -- built from JOB_TOOLS itself so a\n538:    something useful before touching the picker. Falls back to\n---job.html---\n131:   real gate mes.jobs._validate_status_transition/_require_confirm_ev