{"parentUuid":"8b816386-dcd1-42d9-ac8d-e0a8752a98fd","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"d85b5bbc-88ef-4d18-9246-c7d4d9c197ea","agentId":"afb1dbcc97469a738","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_0179V8HgcZnx8oYZXGFd6rTf","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t\"\"\"Checks for the Job (case) workflow: ``mes.jobs``, ``cuore.services.jobs_bridge``,\n2\t``cuore/api/jobs.py`` and the ``/v/{vin}/job`` page.\n3\t\n4\tSame posture as ``cuore/tests/check_dossier_page.py``: ``CUORE_STATE_DIR`` is\n5\tpointed at a throwaway directory BEFORE cuore is imported, and the real MES\n6\tcorpus on this machine (the Stelvio, VIN below -- chronic EVAP codes,\n7\tP0455/P0440/P0456) is the fixture for the suggested-hypothesis evidence.\n8\t\n9\tFive checks:\n10\t  1. Opening a case via the HTML form lands a job on the page.\n11\t  2. The suggested hypotheses include an EVAP one with >=1 real evidence_for ref.\n12\t  3. Add action + set hypothesis status round trip (both via the HTML forms).\n13\t  4. Closing with an outcome is required and sticks; closing is blocked\n14\t     without a tools-used review or a stated skip reason (see\n15\t     ``mes.tools_kb``/``mes.tool_usage`` and\n16\t     ``cuore.services.jobs_bridge.close_job``), and allowed once one is given.\n17\t  5. The job page renders 200 at 400px with no page-level horizontal overflow.\n18\t\n19\tRun:\n20\t    .venv/Scripts/python.exe cuore/tests/check_jobs_page.py\n21\t\"\"\"\n22\t\n23\tfrom __future__ import annotations\n24\t\n25\timport base64\n26\timport itertools\n27\timport json\n28\timport os\n29\timport socket\n30\timport subprocess\n31\timport sys\n32\timport tempfile\n33\timport time\n34\timport urllib.parse\n35\timport urllib.request\n36\tfrom pathlib import Path\n37\t\n38\tos.environ[\"CUORE_STATE_DIR\"] = tempfile.mkdtemp(prefix=\"cuore-check-jobs-\")\n39\tos.environ.pop(\"CUORE_AUDIT_PATH\", None)\n40\t\n41\tROOT = Path(__file__).resolve().parents[2]\n42\tsys.path.insert(0, str(ROOT))\n43\t\n44\tfrom fastapi.testclient import TestClient  # noqa: E402\n45\t\n46\tfrom cuore.app import create_app  # noqa: E402\n47\t\n48\tVIN = \"ZASFAKPN5J7B88115\"  # the Stelvio -- real corpus, chronic P0455/P0440/P0456\n49\t\n50\tfailures: list[str] = []\n51\tchecks = 0\n52\t\n53\t\n54\tdef check(label: str, cond: bool, detail: str = \"\") -> None:\n55\t    global checks\n56\t    checks += 1\n57\t    if not cond:\n58\t        failures.append(f\"{label}{(' -- ' + detail) if detail else ''}\")\n59\t\n60\t"}]},"uuid":"5f22931c-9480-4cea-80df-e56b4a0b3419","timestamp":"2026-10-14T00:34:36.923Z","toolUseResult":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"C:\\Users\\User\\mcp-servers\\cuore\\tests\\check_jobs_page.py","content":"\"\"\"Checks for the Job (case) workflow: ``mes.jobs``, ``cuore.services.jobs_bridge``,\n``cuore/api/jobs.py`` and the ``/v/{vin}/job`` page.\n\nSame posture as ``cuore/tests/check_dossier_page.py``: ``CUORE_STATE_DIR`` is\npointed at a throwaway directory BEFORE cuore is imported, and the real MES\ncorpus on this machine (the Stelvio, VIN below -- chronic EVAP codes,\nP0455/P0440/P0456) is the fixture for the suggested-hypothesis evidence.\n\nFive checks:\n  1. Opening a case via the HTML form lands a job on the page.\n  2. The suggested hypotheses include an EVAP one with >=1 real evidence_for ref.\n  3. Add action + set hypothesis status round trip (both via the HTML forms).\n  4. Closing with an outcome is required and sticks; closing is blocked\n     without a tools-used review or a stated skip reason (see\n     ``mes.tools_kb``/``mes.tool_usage`` and\n     ``cuore.services.jobs_bridge.close_job``), and allowed once one is given.\n  5. The job page renders 200 at 400px with no page-level horizontal overflow.\n\nRun:\n    .venv/Scripts/python.exe cuore/tests/check_jobs_page.py\n\"\"\"\n\nfrom __future__ import annotations\n\nimport base64\nimport itertools\nimport json\nimport os\nimport socket\nimport subprocess\nimport sys\nimport tempfile\nimport time\nimport urllib.parse\nimport urllib.request\nfrom pathlib import Path\n\nos.environ[\"CUORE_STATE_DIR\"] = tempfile.mkdtemp(prefix=\"cuore-check-jobs-\")\nos.environ.pop(\"CUORE_AUDIT_PATH\", None)\n\nROOT = Path(__file__).resolve().parents[2]\nsys.path.insert(0, str(ROOT))\n\nfrom fastapi.testclient import TestClient  # noqa: E402\n\nfrom cuore.app import create_app  # noqa: E402\n\nVIN = \"ZASFAKPN5J7B88115\"  # the Stelvio -- real corpus, chronic P0455/P0440/P0456\n\nfailures: list[str] = []\nchecks = 0\n\n\ndef check(label: str, cond: bool, detail: str = \"\") -> None:\n    global checks\n    checks += 1\n    if not cond:\n        failures.append(f\"{label}{(' -- ' + detail) if detail else ''}\")\n\n","numLines":60,"startLine":1,"totalLines":379}},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"8b816386-dcd1-42d9-ac8d-e0a8752a98fd","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"C:\\Users\\User\\mcp-servers","sessionId":"7cb02eb5-e299-4baf-b34b-9eb82aebbf17","version":"2.1.282","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"binary-splashing-comet"}
