{"parentUuid":"ed422739-8067-4a90-9840-d89554364335","isSidechain":true,"agentId":"afb1dbcc97469a738","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5","id":"msg_011Cg1DSoyhGiQFZ2DQBXztu","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01Ubktp7oyAWdSkgKoYuU6fS","name":"SubagentHandback","input":{"message":"Done. Root cause: cuore/services/dossier_bridge.py built codes-returned only from MES-log history + clear_assessment, ignoring from-car observations.\n\nFixed in dossier_bridge.py: new _latest_live_dtcs/_live_module_dtcs/_module_dtc_state read from-car obd_dtcs and module_dtcs (UDS 0x19) observations; any ACTIVE code (obd or module) flips verdict to ACTIVE_FAULTS, basis cites \"returned/active, read from the car <time>\", \"no code has returned\" never renders when live evidence exists, summary says \"EVAP monitor ran and the code returned\" when applicable, mil_on exposed from readiness. Module codes classified ACTIVE (testFailed/pendingDTC) vs HISTORY (confirmedDTC only) vs absent (status-64-only); 3+ live U-codes fold into the existing generic \"network\" open-work card. Added _build_live_freeze_frames and _build_mode06_view (Mode 06 rows + EVAP fail evidence items, kind \"measurement\"); next_action now names \"Test A\" when an EVAP Mode06 MID fails.\n\nops.py: obd_freeze_frame now records kind=\"freeze_frame\" observations (was unstamped). mes/jobs.py: added \"measurement\" to REF_KINDS so Mode06 evidence can attach.\n\nTemplates: report.html (live freeze frames + Mode 06 block + MIL line), bench.html (collapsed Mode06 count), system.html (EVAP-only live freeze/mode06), job.html (step-7 picker offers Mode06 item), tests.html (read-only \"From the car\" strip, evap_smoke untouched). jobs_bridge.py auto-suggests (never auto-attaches) the Mode06 evidence on the EVAP ESIM hypothesis.\n\nNew test cuore/tests/check_live_ingest.py: 30/30 checks pass (ACTIVE_FAULTS, from-car wording, no \"no code has returned\", freeze-frame fuel_level 28.6/purge 18.0, Mode06 3A FAIL, step-7 picker, \"Test A\" next action, U1713-2F ACTIVE/B1176-97 HISTORY/status-64 absent, no-fixture VIN untouched).\n\nRegression: check_bench(59), check_dossier_page(42), check_jobs_page(24), check_tests_page(55), check_job_ux(57), check_screens, check_system_page(94) — all pass, no --fix-flags needed."},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1889,"cache_read_input_tokens":290158,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":1889,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"wireToolInputs":{"toolu_01Ubktp7oyAWdSkgKoYuU6fS":{"message":"Done. Root cause: cuore/services/dossier_bridge.py built codes-returned only from MES-log history + clear_assessment, ignoring from-car observations.\n\nFixed in dossier_bridge.py: new _latest_live_dtcs/_live_module_dtcs/_module_dtc_state read from-car obd_dtcs and module_dtcs (UDS 0x19) observations; any ACTIVE code (obd or module) flips verdict to ACTIVE_FAULTS, basis cites \"returned/active, read from the car <time>\", \"no code has returned\" never renders when live evidence exists, summary says \"EVAP monitor ran and the code returned\" when applicable, mil_on exposed from readiness. Module codes classified ACTIVE (testFailed/pendingDTC) vs HISTORY (confirmedDTC only) vs absent (status-64-only); 3+ live U-codes fold into the existing generic \"network\" open-work card. Added _build_live_freeze_frames and _build_mode06_view (Mode 06 rows + EVAP fail evidence items, kind \"measurement\"); next_action now names \"Test A\" when an EVAP Mode06 MID fails.\n\nops.py: obd_freeze_frame now records kind=\"freeze_frame\" observations (was unstamped). mes/jobs.py: added \"measurement\" to REF_KINDS so Mode06 evidence can attach.\n\nTemplates: report.html (live freeze frames + Mode 06 block + MIL line), bench.html (collapsed Mode06 count), system.html (EVAP-only live freeze/mode06), job.html (step-7 picker offers Mode06 item), tests.html (read-only \"From the car\" strip, evap_smoke untouched). jobs_bridge.py auto-suggests (never auto-attaches) the Mode06 evidence on the EVAP ESIM hypothesis.\n\nNew test cuore/tests/check_live_ingest.py: 30/30 checks pass (ACTIVE_FAULTS, from-car wording, no \"no code has returned\", freeze-frame fuel_level 28.6/purge 18.0, Mode06 3A FAIL, step-7 picker, \"Test A\" next action, U1713-2F ACTIVE/B1176-97 HISTORY/status-64 absent, no-fixture VIN untouched).\n\nRegression: check_bench(59), check_dossier_page(42), check_jobs_page(24), check_tests_page(55), check_job_ux(57), check_screens, check_system_page(94) — all pass, no --fix-flags needed."}},"serverClassifierRequest":"2a71f301-e48d-4a25-a469-a7ac3a102581","apiBlockIndex":1,"requestId":"req_011Cg1DSohphbucEHtLBzY6w","attributionAgent":"general-purpose","type":"assistant","uuid":"831561a2-262f-46d6-9049-6f4cf7cbcb5a","timestamp":"2026-10-14T00:53:16.575Z","effort":"high","perTurnEffort":null,"userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"C:\\Users\\User\\mcp-servers","sessionId":"7cb02eb5-e299-4baf-b34b-9eb82aebbf17","version":"2.1.282","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"binary-splashing-comet"}
